#. module: qing_b2b_base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_qing_b2b_base
msgid ""
"# Qing B2B Mobile Ordering\n"
"\n"
"Install Qing B2B Sales with the website inventory addon and enable native pricelists in Sales settings. For each ordering website, enable B2B Ordering in its website record, select its supply warehouse and choose a sales team with a leader or a fallback salesperson. Set the brand, languages, delivery and payment information on that website. Create or grant a native portal account for the buyer and select that website in the account’s B2B Ordering tab. Review the buyer’s sales pricelist and permitted delivery addresses before sharing the site’s `/b2b` entry.\n"
"\n"
"Use the website’s configured warehouse as the stock source. The B2B quote records its own website and warehouse and can be managed from normal Sales quotations. A quotation created from mobile ordering uses the Online source and creates a sales activity. Buyers can locate their own quotes and confirmed orders from the mobile app.\n"
"\n"
"The frontend release manifest is at `/qing_b2b_base/static/app/release.json`. The site serves the bundled app with the Qing API contract documented at `/api/openapi.json`. For a separate frontend origin, add that exact origin to the website’s B2B setting and configure the frontend at runtime.\n"
msgstr ""
"# QingERP B2B 移动订货\n"
"\n"
"安装 QingERP B2B 订货销售和网站库存模块，并在销售设置中启用价格表。打开需要开通订货的网站记录，启用 B2B 订货，选择供货仓，并设置有负责人的销售团队或备用销售员。在该网站上配置品牌、语言、配送和付款说明。为买家创建门户账号或授予门户访问权限，然后在用户的 B2B 订货页签选择该网站。核对买家的销售价格表和允许使用的收货地址后，即可分享网站的 `/b2b` 入口。\n"
"\n"
"订货库存取自网站配置的供货仓。订货生成的报价单会记录所用的网站和仓库，可在销售应用的报价单中处理。手机订货生成的报价单使用“线上”来源，并创建销售跟进活动。买家可以在手机端查看本人的报价单和已确认订单。\n"
"\n"
"前端发布清单位于 `/qing_b2b_base/static/app/release.json`。网站提供打包的订货应用，Qing API 接口文档位于 `/api/openapi.json`。如果前端部署在另一个来源，请在网站的订货设置中加入该完整来源，并在前端运行时配置接口地址。\n"

